<title>USA: Reliv' to list on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Reliv' to list on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTERFIELD, Mo. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliv' International Inc said Tuesday it has taken steps to delist its stock from the American Stock Exchange in order to list it on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to begin trading on Nasdaq on September 6 under the symblo RELV.</p>
<p>Reliv' manufactures and distributes food and diet products, sports drinks and skin care products.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
